## Sprint Execution Sequence

**Phase 1: Safety First (Day 1)**
1. Create regression tests (Scope Contract 4, Layers 1-2)
2. Fix getSelectedProducts.ts empty keys guard (Scope Contract 3)
3. Run tests - verify they pass with new guard
4. Clear Next.js cache: `Remove-Item -Recurse -Force .next`

**Phase 2: Core Fixes (Day 2)**
5. Fix DetailSection.tsx `<a>` → `Link` (Scope Contract 1)
6. Fix page.tsx slug resolution (Scope Contract 2)
7. Add console logging for verification
8. Restart dev server

**Phase 3: Verification (Day 3)**
9. Test all 22 categories manually
10. Verify console shows correct data path for each
11. Verify products match category
12. Full regression test run

**Phase 4: Documentation (Day 4)**
13. Update sprint file with completion status
14. Document any edge cases found
15. Final verification command

---

