## Success Criteria

**Functional**:
- [ ] Clicking catalogue item uses client-side navigation
- [ ] All 22 category paths resolve correct catalogue ID
- [ ] Empty/invalid category returns zero products (not all products)
- [ ] Products displayed match selected category
- [ ] Console shows correct data path for each category

**Performance**:
- [ ] Navigation <100ms (client-side)
- [ ] Empty category response <10ms
- [ ] No performance regression on valid categories

**Quality**:
- [ ] All regression tests pass
- [ ] All existing tests pass
- [ ] No TypeScript errors in modified files
- [ ] No ESLint warnings in modified files

---

## Rollback Plan

If critical issues arise:
1. Revert `page.tsx` to use `path.join("/")` temporarily
2. Revert `getSelectedProducts.ts` to remove early return
3. Revert `DetailSection.tsx` to use `<a>` tag
4. All changes are isolated - no cascading effects

---

